+//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+//                         ObjectScriptExportScope
+//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// GMAT: General Mission Analysis Tool.
+//
+// Copyright (c) 2002-2026 United States Government as represented by the
+// Administrator of The National Aeronautics and Space Administration.
+// All Rights Reserved.
